    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "２０ぴきぜんごの　グループを　つくる。 そのけっそくは　ひじょうに　かたく ぜったい　なかまを　みすてない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ils se rassemblent par groupes de vingt. Dans cette formation très soudée, nul ne songerait une seule seconde à abandonner ses alliés.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "２０匹前後の　グループを　つくる。 その結束は　非常に　固く 絶対　仲間を　見捨てない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "かたい　きのみを　つかい　たたかう。 そのテクニックは　だいだいの　ボスから グループの　なかまに　うけつがれる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il choisit les Baies les plus dures pour s’en servir au combat : un stratagème bien rodé que les chefs de groupe enseignent à leurs alliés.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They battle with hard berries for weapons. Their techniques are passed from the boss to the group, generation upon generation.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "硬い　木の実を　使い　戦う。 そのテクニックは　代々の　ボスから グループの　仲間に　受け継がれる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "だえきを　つかって　はっぱを　かたに はりつけて　マーキング。　はっぱの はいちで　どの　むれか　わかるよ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il utilise sa salive pour coller des feuilles sur ses épaules. Leur disposition indique son appartenance à un groupe particulier.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "唾液を　使って　葉っぱを　肩に 貼り付けて　マーキング。　葉っぱの 配置で　どの　群れか　わかるよ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "きのみは　ぶきで　あり　しゅしょく。 むれの　なかで　１ばん　とおくまで きのみを　なげられるものが　ボスだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les Baies constituent à la fois son arme et la base de son alimentation. Celui qui peut les lancer le plus loin devient le chef du groupe.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Berries are its weapons as well as the staple of its diet. The one that can throw a berry the farthest is the boss of the troop.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "きのみは　武器で　あり　主食。 群れの　中で　１番　遠くまで きのみを　投げられるものが　ボスだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ボスの　しじに　したがい　みごとな チームプレイで　こうぶつの　きのみを さがして　なかまどうし　たすけあう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ils obéissent à leur chef au doigt et à l’œil, et travaillent en équipe pour dénicher leurs Baies favorites.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Displaying amazing teamwork, they follow the orders of their boss as they all help out in the search for their favorite berries.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ボスの　指示に　従い　見事な チームプレイで　好物の　木の実を 探して　仲間同士　助け合う。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "２０ぴきほどの　グループで　くらす。 きまった　やくわりを　こなすことで きびしい　しぜんを　いきぬいてきた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ils vivent en groupes de vingt individus où chacun a un rôle précis, ce qui leur a permis de survivre dans un environnement impitoyable.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "２０匹ほどの　グループで　暮らす。 決まった　役割を　こなすことで 厳しい　自然を　生き抜いてきた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
